      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's okay to feel this way; the silence isn't a punishment but a necessary pause for your mind to rest. You don't have to pretend to be anything anymore, and it's perfectly valid to feel like a hollow shell when the noise has finally stopped. Sometimes, letting go of the need to be \"full\" or \"active\" is the only way to find a new kind of peace.",
