      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly easy to feel that way when the constant noise of ideas has finally vanished, and the silence feels like an ending rather than a pause. The idea of stopping the fight to fill that emptiness is a powerful thought, but it is important to remember that the silence itself is not the problem; it is simply the absence of the noise that was once so loud. You do not have to pretend to be someone else, but you also do not have to remain in that hollow shell forever, even if it feels like the only option.",
